id: pm-1j8u
title: Use the pm SDK for preset seed creation
description: "Replace the CLI subprocess seed writer from the 2026-10-25 SDK audit with the injected PmClient.create. Preserve ordered per-item partial results and dry-run output. Retain audited settings mutation and raw vendor/base settings for lossless upgrades; prove parity using public tracker copies, corruption after cache priming, behavioral reverts, and npm/Bun release gates."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: refactor,sdk-adoption,seeds
created_at: "2026-10-25T18:24:04.230Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-26T03:28:37.469Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-26T03:26:11.173Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-25T18:45:36.000Z"
author: codex-agent
resolution: "Delivered by PR #160, merge 6046edba0dceb99db56facaa6ee92510d643c9c4, merged 2026-10-25T18:45:36Z. src/seeds.ts awaits invocation-bound PmClient.create independently for each seed; src/index.ts supplies the active host client. tests/seeds.test.ts and tests/seeds-sdk.test.ts cover author, partial failure, all presets and custom types without pm/git, while docs/sdk-adoption-evidence.md retains 28 matching differential cases and behavioural revert evidence."
expected_result: "Native seed creation preserves invocation context, ordered partial success and dry-run behavior, audited settings/history and lossless upgrades."
actual_result: All 22 focused regressions pass directly and through pinned pm with self-isolating snapshot/none context. The schema sandbox redirects PM_PATH away from the test-created extension and causes Unknown command presets. Persisting snapshot/none test metadata is refused by the older supported host floor because it requires guarded item format 2; pins and stored test metadata stay unchanged. The explicit passing execution overrides are retained in the PR receipt.
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T18:24:26.306Z",codex-agent,"Audit scope: src/seeds.ts creates each seed through a CLI subprocess; replace it with the invocation-bound sdk.client.create, preserving ordered independent partial successes (no shared batch/replay precondition exists, so commitItemMutations would change semantics). Related prior SDK adoption: pm-bzvf for template reads and pm-1vx6 for audited settings. src/presets/shared.ts and src/upgrade.ts already delegate settings writes to mutateWorkspaceSettings; keep raw vendor/base settings because readSettings strips unknown fields and cannot support lossless upgrades. No SDK dependency bump. Baseline: origin/main 117a077."
  "2026-10-25T18:28:15.524Z",codex-agent,"Implemented injected PmClient.create and awaited command completion; removed spawnSync and child-process outcome handling. Preserve buildSeedCreateArgs only as a pure manual-command preview for planSeeds consumers: renderPmCommand accepts already-tokenized argv, and the pinned SDK has no structured create-options-to-argv preview API, so deleting that presentation helper would break the existing plan.command contract. It is never used for writes. Keep independent seeds, not commitItemMutations: no shared replay/precondition boundary exists. Native real-tracker tests cover partial successes, author attribution, empty/foreign provider diagnostics, no executable on PATH, and both custom item types through the installed host. Corruption after priming listMutationEvents is detected by the unchanged audited settings mutation before templates or seed writes."
  "2026-10-25T18:31:28.392Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof for seed writer replacement: run the new installed-host all-presets regression against the origin/main build (same remaining sources, only seed functions and their callsite reverted). node --test --test-name-pattern=\"SDK seed all-presets\" tests/seeds-sdk.test.ts fails 0/1 at the first seed with spawnSync pm ENOENT when PATH is empty. Candidate passes 2/2 no-git/no-pm scenarios including corrupt-after-cache. Linked pm test execution passed 22/22 with zero failures/skips. Initial full suite passed 196/196 but exposed one pre-existing uncovered foreign-value branch in audited settings error formatting (99.85% branches); added a real SDK callback refusal test with unchanged-state assertions rather than weakening thresholds. Canonical pm-ops lint found only async test-array resets; replaced those resets with splice and reran clean. Its optional Babel/ESLint peers were supplied in a scratch tool environment without altering the package dependency graph."
  "2026-10-25T18:32:52.365Z",codex-agent,"Differential proof passed 28/28 command observations: all seven presets, dry-run and with-seeds application, on read-only public tracker snapshots from pm-presets 117a077 and pm-review d65d149. Both origin/main archives were built/read with pinned dependencies; disposable non-git overlays use the same host, author and active schema. Exit codes, stdout/stderr and full created item content match after normalizing only scratch root, random item IDs and timestamps. Existing records and source snapshot hashes remain unchanged. Exact commits, snapshot digests, reproduction command and finding dispositions are in docs/sdk-adoption-evidence.md. No output or item-content differences in the measured cases."
  "2026-10-25T18:37:36.332Z",codex-agent,"Final local gates passed: env HOME=$(mktemp -d) GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check and the same environment with bun run release:check each passed 197/197 tests, zero failed/canceled/skipped, and 100% lines/branches/functions across all 23 required source files at unchanged thresholds. Typecheck, 137-declaration docstrings, audit (0 vulnerabilities), pack dry-run, changelog check, release attestation/date gates and strict CI-style tracker health passed. Canonical pm-ops ESLint on all changed TypeScript passed. Additional before/after invalid-first/valid-second seed probe preserves 1 success/1 failure and the stored valid item, but intentionally replaces the generic CLI headline Error: Invalid argument value with native SDK invalid-type detail; README and differential harness name this difference. All 28 public-snapshot command comparisons match. Source deletion count: 26 lines across src/seeds.ts and src/index.ts. Only preview argv and raw vendor/base settings remain for the reasons already recorded. Ready for PR CI and orchestrator verification; item is not closed."
  "2026-10-26T03:17:06.057Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit on main 6c792db05bc05eabd75bb373e03feab68b7492aa: merged PR #160 (6046edba0dceb99db56facaa6ee92510d643c9c4, merged 2026-10-25T18:45:36Z). src/seeds.ts awaits invocation-bound PmClient.create independently for each seed; src/index.ts supplies the active host client. tests/seeds.test.ts and tests/seeds-sdk.test.ts cover author, partial failure, all presets and custom types without pm/git, while docs/sdk-adoption-evidence.md retains 28 matching differential cases and behavioural revert evidence. All scoped acceptance criteria are represented by the inspected implementation and regressions. Existing behavioural revert evidence is retained; this tracker-only audit changes no runtime functions."
  "2026-10-26T03:28:37.463Z",codex-agent,"Evidence correction: snapshot/none overrides pass 22/22; attempting to persist that context was refused by the supported-host guarded-format check. The linked-test metadata remains unchanged. The earlier closure actual_result sentence claiming that the stored context was updated was inaccurate and is corrected by this append-only mutation. Pinned dependencies and runtime source remain unchanged."
